  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build urban communities resilience to food insecurity by building their skills, physical assets, knowledge and urban rural market linkages.  This will increase food security for a minimum of 15,500 urban households, benefitting  108,500 of the  poorest and most vulnerable by December 2015.To build urban communities resilience to food insecurity by building their skills, physical assets, knowledge and urban rural market linkages.  This will increase food security for a minimum of 15,500 urban households, benefitting  108,500 of the  poorest and most vulnerable by December 2015.</narrative>
